<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 93,958 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 93,958 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 93,958 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Thursday, compared to 83,226 tonnes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Thursday	  Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			26,935	    22,715</p>
<p>    Import cargo			67,023	    60,511</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, three ships sailed and two berthed. In the next 24 hours, nine ships were expected to sail and 13 were expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
